    {
      "id": "p00001",
      "text": "Candide did not take courage, but followed the old woman to a decayed\nhouse, where she gave him a pot of pomatum to anoint his sores, showed\nhim a very neat little bed, with a suit of clothes hanging up, and left\nhim something to eat and drink.",
      "translation": "Candide ne prit point courage, mais il suivit la vieille dans une\nmasure: elle lui donna un pot de pommade pour se frotter, lui laissa à\nmanger et à boire; elle lui montra un petit lit assez propre; il y\navait auprès du lit un habit complet.",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p00001",
      "target_paragraph_id": "fr-p00001",
      "languages": {
        "base": "en",
        "learning": "fr"
      },
      "replacements": [
