    {
      "id": "p00008",
      "text": "The next\nmorning the old woman brought him his breakfast, looked at his back, and\nrubbed it herself with another ointment: in like manner she brought him\nhis dinner; and at night she returned with his supper.",
      "translation": "Le lendemain la\nvieille lui apporte à déjeuner, visite son dos, le frotte elle-même\nd’une autre pommade: elle lui apporte ensuite à dîner: elle revient sur\nle soir et apporte à souper.",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p00005",
      "target_paragraph_id": "fr-p00002",
      "languages": {
        "base": "en",
        "learning": "fr"
      },
