    },
    {
      "id": "p00011",
      "text": "said Candide; \"who has inspired you with so much\ngoodness?",
      "translation": "lui disait toujours Candide; qui vous a\ninspiré tant de bonté?",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p00006",
      "target_paragraph_id": "fr-p00002",
      "languages": {
        "base": "en",
        "learning": "fr"
      },
      "replacements": [],
      "sentences": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00012",
      "text": "What return can I make you?\"",
      "translation": "quelles grâces puis-je vous rendre?",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p00006",
      "target_paragraph_id": "fr-p00002",
      "languages": {
        "base": "en",
        "learning": "fr"
      },
      "replacements": [],
      "sentences": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00013",
      "text": "The good woman made no answer; she returned in the evening, but brought\nno supper.\n\n\"Come with me,\" she said, \"and say nothing.\"",
      "translation": "La bonne\nfemme ne répondait jamais rien. Elle revint sur le soir, et n’apporta\npoint à souper: Venez avec moi, dit-elle, et ne dites mot.",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p00007",
      "target_paragraph_id": "fr-p00002",
      "languages": {
        "base": "en",
        "learning": "fr"
      },
      "replacements": [],
      "sentences": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00014",
      "text": "She took him by the arm, and walked with him about a quarter of a mile\ninto the country; they arrived at a lonely house, surrounded with\ngardens and canals.",
      "translation": "Elle le\nprend sous le bras, et marche avec lui dans la campagne environ un\nquart de mille: ils arrivent à une maison isolée, entourée de jardins\net de canaux.",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p00009",
      "target_paragraph_id": "fr-p00002",
      "languages": {
        "base": "en",
        "learning": "fr"
