    {
      "id": "p00015",
      "text": "The old woman knocked at a little door, it opened,\nshe led Candide up a private staircase into a small apartment richly\nfurnished. She left him on a brocaded sofa, shut the door and went away.",
      "translation": "La vieille frappe à une petite porte. On ouvre; elle mène\nCandide, par un escalier dérobé, dans un cabinet doré, le laisse sur un\ncanapé de brocart, referme la porte, et s’en va.",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p00009",
      "target_paragraph_id": "fr-p00002",
      "languages": {
        "base": "en",
        "learning": "fr"
      },
      "replacements": [],
      "sentences": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00016",
      "text": "Candide thought himself in a dream; indeed, that he had been dreaming\nunluckily all his life, and that the present moment was the only\nagreeable part of it all.",
      "translation": "Candide croyait rêver,\net regardait toute sa vie comme un songe funeste, et le moment présent\ncomme un songe agréable.",
      "paragraph_id": "en-p00009",
      "target_paragraph_id": "fr-p00002",
      "languages": {
        "base": "en",
        "learning": "fr"
      },
